  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="US9298709B2">
      <data key="d0">US9298709B2</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">A patent publication titled "Computer system to visualize data from an IP rights database," describing a data processing system for visualizing IP rights data on a geographic map.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9298709B2-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US9298709B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284105</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Data Processing System">
      <data key="d0">Data Processing System</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A computer system (10) that visualizes data from an IP rights database as a geographic map with a viewable area, generating and updating data visualizations based on the current map coordinates and restriction criteria.&lt;SEP&gt;A system having one or more processors and memory configured to evaluate information via a computer network, including receiving user interest indications, determining keyword weights, ranking keywords, and selecting advertisements.&lt;SEP&gt;A computer-based system that detects user interest, identifies keywords, determines keyword weights, receives content requests, ranks keywords, and selects content for display with information resources.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9298709B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9304738B1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9304738B1-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9298709B2.txt&lt;SEP&gt;US9304738B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284192</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="IP Rights Database">
      <data key="d0">IP Rights Database</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">A database containing intellectual property rights records, including geographic addresses of IP right owners, used as the source for generating lists of IP rights.&lt;SEP&gt;A database containing IP rights records, including geographic addresses of IP right owners, from which lists of IP rights are generated and restricted.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9298709B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9298709B2-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9298709B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284105</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Geographic Map">
      <data key="d0">Geographic Map</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A displayed geographic map having a viewable area whose geographic coordinates define the geographic area used to filter IP rights by owner address.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9298709B2-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US9298709B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284105</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Map Display Change Monitor">
      <data key="d0">Map Display Change Monitor</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A component (23) that receives and stores geographic coordinates of the viewable area, compares current with previously stored coordinates, and generates a display change notification, including after a pre-defined time period with no change.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9298709B2-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US9298709B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284105</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Display Change Notification">
      <data key="d0">Display Change Notification</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">A notification issued upon detecting a change in the viewable area of the geographic map, generated after a pre-defined time period elapses with no change in the viewable area.&lt;SEP&gt;A notification generated by the map display change monitor including the geographic coordinates of the current viewable area of the geographic map.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9298709B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9298709B2-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9298709B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284105</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="IP Rights List Generator">
      <data key="d0">IP Rights List Generator</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A component (37) that generates a list of IP rights from the IP rights database whose owner's geographic address falls within the current map area, and restricts the list based on restriction criteria to form a restricted list.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9298709B2-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US9298709B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284105</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Restriction Criteria Interface">
      <data key="d0">Restriction Criteria Interface</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A component that ascertains one or more restriction criteria related to the IP rights used to restrict the list of IP rights.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9298709B2-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US9298709B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284105</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Restriction Criteria">
      <data key="d0">Restriction Criteria</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Criteria related to IP rights used to restrict a list of IP rights, including IP jurisdiction, type of IP right, technology type, industry type, filing date, number of applications, owner type, representative listing, IPC classes, and trademark classes.&lt;SEP&gt;Criteria related to IP rights used to restrict the list, including IP jurisdiction, type of IP right, technology type, industry type, filing date, owner filing count, owner type, representative listing, IPC classes, and trademark classes.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9298709B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9298709B2-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9298709B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284105</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Restricted List Of IP Rights">
      <data key="d0">Restricted List Of IP Rights</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">A list of IP rights filtered from the IP rights database based on one or more restriction criteria related to the IP rights.&lt;SEP&gt;A list of IP rights filtered by geographic area of owner address and by one or more restriction criteria, from which data visualizations are derived.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9298709B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9298709B2-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9298709B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284105</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Information Display Generator">
      <data key="d0">Information Display Generator</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A component that generates and displays an information pane containing data visualizations derived from a restricted list of IP rights, updating them based on geographic co-ordinates of the current viewable area.&lt;SEP&gt;A component (26) that generates and displays an information pane containing data visualizations derived from the restricted list of IP rights and updates them upon each successive display change notification.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9298709B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9298709B2-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9298709B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284105</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Information Pane">
      <data key="d0">Information Pane</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A display area containing one or more data visualizations related to a restricted list of IP rights.&lt;SEP&gt;A displayed pane containing one or more data visualizations derived from the restricted list of IP rights.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9298709B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9298709B2-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9298709B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284105</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Data Visualization">
      <data key="d0">Data Visualization</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Visual representations generated in the information pane from the restricted list of IP rights, including technology type charts, industry type charts, filing trend analysis charts, owner filing size charts, and lists of IP rights owners.&lt;SEP&gt;Visualizations derived from the restricted list of IP rights, such as technology type charts, industry type charts, filing trend analysis charts, and IP rights owner filing size charts.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9298709B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9298709B2-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9298709B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284105</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Data Visualization Selector">
      <data key="d0">Data Visualization Selector</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A component that allows the user to select one or more data visualizations based on the restriction criteria.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9298709B2-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US9298709B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284105</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Geographic Map Display Interface">
      <data key="d0">Geographic Map Display Interface</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">An interface that displays a geographic map having a viewable area.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9298709B2-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US9298709B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284105</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="IP Right Owner">
      <data key="d0">IP Right Owner</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">An individual or corporation owning one or more IP rights, whose geographic address is used to determine inclusion within a geographic area.&lt;SEP&gt;An owner of an IP right whose geographic address is used to determine whether the IP right falls within the current viewable map area; may be an individual or a corporation.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9298709B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9298709B2-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9298709B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284105</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="User History Of Use">
      <data key="d0">User History Of Use</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">A history of use of the system provided by storing geographic coordinates of the viewable area for an entire session or multiple sessions.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9298709B2-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US9298709B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284105</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="IPC Classes">
      <data key="d0">IPC Classes</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Defined International Patent Classification classes used as a restriction criterion for classifying patent IP rights.&lt;SEP&gt;Defined International Patent Classification classes used as a restriction criterion for patent IP rights.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9298709B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9298709B2-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9298709B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284105</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Filing Trend Analysis Chart">
      <data key="d0">Filing Trend Analysis Chart</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A data visualization chart showing filing trend analysis for the IP rights.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9298709B2-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US9298709B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284105</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="IP Rights Owner Filing Size Chart">
      <data key="d0">IP Rights Owner Filing Size Chart</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A data visualization chart showing the filing size of IP rights owners.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9298709B2-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US9298709B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284105</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Geographic Map Display">
      <data key="d0">Geographic Map Display</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A display component showing a geographic map with a viewable area defined by geographic co-ordinates, used to spatially filter IP rights by owner address.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9298709B2-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9298709B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284105</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Map Change Message">
      <data key="d0">Map Change Message</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">A message generated in relation to a change in the viewable area of the geographic map, generated after a pre-defined time period elapses and there has been no change in the viewable area.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9298709B2-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9298709B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284105</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="IP Rights">
      <data key="d0">IP Rights</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Intellectual property rights, such as patents and trademarks, that are listed, restricted, and visualized based on owner geographic addresses and restriction criteria.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9298709B2-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9298709B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284105</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Geographic Co-Ordinates">
      <data key="d0">Geographic Co-Ordinates</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Coordinates defining the current viewable area of the geographic map display, used to determine the geographic area for filtering IP rights and to update data visualizations.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9298709B2-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9298709B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284105</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="User Initiated Command">
      <data key="d0">User Initiated Command</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">A command initiated by a user, such as pressing an on-screen button, that triggers generation or updating of data visualizations.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9298709B2-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9298709B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284105</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="On-Screen Button">
      <data key="d0">On-Screen Button</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A button displayed on screen that a user presses to initiate a command for updating data visualizations.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9298709B2-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9298709B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284105</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Trademark Classes">
      <data key="d0">Trademark Classes</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Defined classes used as a restriction criterion for classifying trademark IP rights.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9298709B2-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9298709B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284105</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="US8509827B2">
      <data key="d0">US8509827B2</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">A patent publication titled "Methods and apparatus of context-data acquisition and ranking" that discloses a system, method, and article of manufacture for acquiring and ranking context data based on a query derived from a short message.</data>
      <data key="d3">US8509827B2-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US8509827B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284123</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Context-Data Acquisition And Ranking">
      <data key="d0">Context-Data Acquisition And Ranking</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A method of determining a context-data type from a query, identifying context-data sources, generating requests for context data, and ranking received context data according to a specified parameter.</data>
      <data key="d3">US8509827B2-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US8509827B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284123</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Context-Data Type">
      <data key="d0">Context-Data Type</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A classification of context data determined algorithmically from the meaning of a term of a short message, providing information about the environment or context of a mobile device.</data>
      <data key="d3">US8509827B2-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US8509827B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284123</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Context-Data Source">
      <data key="d0">Context-Data Source</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A provider that supplies context data of a given context-data type and can be ranked according to a specified parameter such as pecuniary cost.</data>
      <data key="d3">US8509827B2-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US8509827B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284123</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Short Message">
      <data key="d0">Short Message</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">A message whose content has a meaning to which context-data is related, and to which relevant context data is linked.&lt;SEP&gt;A message received from a mobile device, whose term meanings are used to determine a context-data type and to which received context data may be appended or encoded.</data>
      <data key="d3">US8509827B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US8509827B2-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US8509827B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284123</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Mobile Device">
      <data key="d0">Mobile Device</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A device that generates a short message and a query, and to which received context data may be provided; may be a smart phone.&lt;SEP&gt;A portable device including at least a camera and a screen, running an application in operative communication with the camera and an Internet access mechanism. It may be a mobile phone, tablet, PDA, or dedicated camera.&lt;SEP&gt;A device including at least a camera and a screen, used to interact with a social networking service; may be a mobile phone, tablet, PDA, or dedicated camera.</data>
      <data key="d3">US8509827B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US8917913B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US8917913B2-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US8509827B2.txt&lt;SEP&gt;US8917913B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284304</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Server">
      <data key="d0">Server</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">At least one server associated with a context-data provider used to collect a set of context-data.&lt;SEP&gt;A computing system that receives short messages from mobile devices, determines context-data types, identifies and ranks context-data sources, and generates requests for context data.&lt;SEP&gt;A computing system that receives requests, traverses social networks to identify connecting persons, and sends identifiers or responses to the requesting person's computer.&lt;SEP&gt;A server hosted by the computing device that performs the typographical error classification operations.&lt;SEP&gt;A computing system that streams video content features to a client.&lt;SEP&gt;A server that receives data comprising characteristics of e-mail exchanges from the interaction database, assigns weights to characteristics, and transfers data to a processor.&lt;SEP&gt;A server that receives data comprising characteristics of e-mail exchanges, assigns weights to characteristics, and transfers data to a processor for generating relationship data.</data>
      <data key="d3">US8509827B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US8509827B2-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;US9118735B1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9514120B1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9374411B1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US10778629B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US10778629B2-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US8509827B2.txt&lt;SEP&gt;US9118735B1.txt&lt;SEP&gt;US9514120B1.txt&lt;SEP&gt;US9374411B1.txt&lt;SEP&gt;US10778629B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284708</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Specified Parameter">
      <data key="d0">Specified Parameter</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A criterion used to rank context-data sources, comprising a pecuniary cost to acquire context data, a state of the receiving mobile device, a state of an available communication network, or a cost value of the context data.</data>
      <data key="d3">US8509827B2-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US8509827B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284123</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Recipient Mobile Device">
      <data key="d0">Recipient Mobile Device</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A mobile device that receives context data, possibly associated with or appended to a short message, or a URI of a database server.</data>
      <data key="d3">US8509827B2-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US8509827B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284123</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Database">
      <data key="d0">Database</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A storage system available to a recipient mobile device in which received context data may be stored and queried via metadata instructions.&lt;SEP&gt;A storage that holds a plurality of keywords and their associated weights, associated with a parked domain web page having a unique identifier.&lt;SEP&gt;A storage system from which keywords of advertisements are identified using the unique identifier of the parked domain web page and in which increased keyword weights are associated with the parked domain web page.&lt;SEP&gt;A searchable database in which management data is stored in a searchable format.&lt;SEP&gt;A searchable storage repository in which extracted management data is stored for subsequent review and query by users and administrators.&lt;SEP&gt;A searchable database in which the management data is stored in a searchable format.&lt;SEP&gt;A searchable storage system in which management data is stored.</data>
      <data key="d3">US8509827B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9304738B1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9304738B1-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;US7756837B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US7756837B2-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;US7756837B2-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;US7756837B2-chunk-003</data>
      <data key="d4">US8509827B2.txt&lt;SEP&gt;US9304738B1.txt&lt;SEP&gt;US7756837B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284549</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Uniform Resource Identifier">
      <data key="d0">Uniform Resource Identifier</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">An identifier of a database server that may be forwarded to a receiving mobile device.</data>
      <data key="d3">US8509827B2-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US8509827B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284123</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Markup Language">
      <data key="d0">Markup Language</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
