      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">An entity with at least one server that collects and provides a set of context-data, and is allowed to provide a cost of the context-data.&lt;SEP&gt;A provider from which a set of context data related to the meaning of short message content is collected by a server.</data>
      <data key="d3">US8509827B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US8509827B2-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US8509827B2.txt</data>
