    <node id="US9304738B1">
      <data key="d0">US9304738B1</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">A patent document titled "Systems and methods for selecting content using weighted terms" describing techniques for evaluating information via a computer network using weighted keywords.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9304738B1-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US9304738B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284192</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Parked Domain Web Page">
      <data key="d0">Parked Domain Web Page</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">A web page with a unique identifier that lacks content having keywords other than content provided via the data processing system, and on which advertisements are displayed.&lt;SEP&gt;A web page with a unique identifier that lacks content with keywords other than content provided via the data processing system, used to display advertisements.&lt;SEP&gt;A web page displayed on a parked domain that shows advertisements and content selected based on ranked keywords.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9304738B1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9304738B1-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;US9304738B1-chunk-002</data>
      <data key="d4">US9304738B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284192</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Keyword">
      <data key="d0">Keyword</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">A term associated with advertisements displayed on a parked domain web page, having a weight determined based on user interest and historic performance.&lt;SEP&gt;A term associated with subject matter of an information resource or advertisement, assigned a weight used for content selection.&lt;SEP&gt;A term from a plurality of keywords that carries a weight on the parked domain web page and a different weight on a second information resource, and is used for ranking and advertisement selection.&lt;SEP&gt;Keywords of the data files of the data-stream, obtained by indexing types of data, included in the management data.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9304738B1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9304738B1-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;US9304738B1-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;US7756837B2-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US9304738B1.txt&lt;SEP&gt;US7756837B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284549</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Weight">
      <data key="d0">Weight</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A value assigned to a keyword based on user interest indications and historic performance, used to rank and select keywords.&lt;SEP&gt;A value determined for each keyword of an information resource based on user interest indications and historic performance, used to rank and select keywords.&lt;SEP&gt;A value applied to each recommender, which may be site-specific, user-specific, user segment-specific, or default, and is adjusted based on user-generated events.&lt;SEP&gt;A value assigned to each of the plurality of characteristics for each pair of users, used to determine relationship strength.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9304738B1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9304738B1-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;US7991757B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US10778629B2-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9304738B1.txt&lt;SEP&gt;US7991757B2.txt&lt;SEP&gt;US10778629B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284708</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Advertisement">
      <data key="d0">Advertisement</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">An advertisement displayed with a parked domain web page, associated with one or more keywords and selected for display based on keyword weights.&lt;SEP&gt;Content displayed on a parked domain web page, associated with keywords and selected for display based on ranked keywords.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9304738B1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9304738B1-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9304738B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284192</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="First Advertisement">
      <data key="d0">First Advertisement</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">An advertisement displayed with a parked domain web page, associated with a first keyword and in which the first user indicates interest.&lt;SEP&gt;An advertisement displayed on the parked domain web page that a first user showed interest in, associated with a first keyword.&lt;SEP&gt;An advertisement displayed on the parked domain web page, distinct from the second and third advertisements.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9304738B1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9304738B1-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;US9304738B1-chunk-002</data>
      <data key="d4">US9304738B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284192</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Second Advertisement">
      <data key="d0">Second Advertisement</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">An advertisement displayed on the parked domain web page, associated with a second keyword and in which the second user indicates interest.&lt;SEP&gt;An advertisement displayed on the parked domain web page that a second user showed interest in, associated with a second keyword.&lt;SEP&gt;An advertisement displayed on the parked domain web page, associated with the second keyword, in which the second user indicated interest.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9304738B1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9304738B1-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;US9304738B1-chunk-002</data>
      <data key="d4">US9304738B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284192</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Third Advertisement">
      <data key="d0">Third Advertisement</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">An advertisement selected to provide for display with the parked domain web page based on the first keyword selected as the highest ranked keyword, different from the first and second advertisements.&lt;SEP&gt;An advertisement selected for display with the parked domain web page based on the first keyword ranked highest, different from the first and second advertisements.&lt;SEP&gt;An advertisement selected to be provided for display with the parked domain web page based at least in part on the first keyword selected as the highest ranked keyword, different from the first and second advertisements.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9304738B1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9304738B1-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;US9304738B1-chunk-002</data>
      <data key="d4">US9304738B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284192</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Fourth Advertisement">
      <data key="d0">Fourth Advertisement</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">An advertisement displayed on the parked domain web page associated with the first keyword, in which user interest may be indicated.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9304738B1-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US9304738B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284192</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="First User">
      <data key="d0">First User</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A user whose indication of interest in a first advertisement displayed on a parked domain web page is received.&lt;SEP&gt;A user who shows interest in the first advertisement displayed on the parked domain web page.&lt;SEP&gt;A user associated with the parked domain web page, distinct from the second and third users.&lt;SEP&gt;A user seeking to find a second user via a social network; the first user has an identifier, a location, and a social network that can be traversed and combined from multiple social network types.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9304738B1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9304738B1-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;US9304738B1-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;US9118735B1-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9304738B1.txt&lt;SEP&gt;US9118735B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284215</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Second User">
      <data key="d0">Second User</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A user, different from the first user, whose indication of interest in a second advertisement displayed on the parked domain web page is received.&lt;SEP&gt;A user who shows interest in the second advertisement displayed on the parked domain web page.&lt;SEP&gt;A user whose indication of interest in the second advertisement is received and used to determine the second weight of the second keyword.&lt;SEP&gt;A user whom the first user is trying to find using the social network; the second user has an associated identifier and a possible location.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9304738B1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9304738B1-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;US9304738B1-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;US9118735B1-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9304738B1.txt&lt;SEP&gt;US9118735B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284215</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Third User">
      <data key="d0">Third User</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A user, different from the first user and the second user, who requests content to provide for display with the parked domain web page.&lt;SEP&gt;A user different from the first and second users who requests content to provide for display with the parked domain web page.&lt;SEP&gt;A user in the first user's social network who is likely to connect the first user's social network with the third user's own social network and whose last-known location is within a predetermined distance from the first user's location; the third user may opt in to sharing identity, social network, or location information.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9304738B1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9304738B1-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;US9304738B1-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;US9118735B1-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9304738B1.txt&lt;SEP&gt;US9118735B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284215</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="First Keyword">
      <data key="d0">First Keyword</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A keyword of the plurality of keywords having a first weight on the parked domain web page and a different weight on a second information resource.&lt;SEP&gt;A keyword of the plurality of keywords having a first weight on the parked domain web page and a different weight on a second information resource, ranked highest to select the third advertisement.&lt;SEP&gt;A keyword of the plurality of keywords having a first weight on the parked domain web page and a different weight on a second information resource; it is ranked and selected as the highest ranked keyword.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9304738B1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9304738B1-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;US9304738B1-chunk-002</data>
      <data key="d4">US9304738B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284192</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Second Keyword">
      <data key="d0">Second Keyword</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A keyword of the plurality of keywords associated with the second advertisement, having a second weight determined based on the second user's interest indication.&lt;SEP&gt;A keyword of the plurality of keywords associated with the second advertisement, having a second weight determined based on the second user's interest.&lt;SEP&gt;A keyword of the plurality of keywords associated with a second advertisement, whose second weight is determined based on an indication of user interest.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9304738B1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9304738B1-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;US9304738B1-chunk-002</data>
      <data key="d4">US9304738B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284192</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Third Keyword">
      <data key="d0">Third Keyword</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A keyword of the plurality of keywords associated with the third advertisement of the parked domain web page.&lt;SEP&gt;A keyword of the plurality of keywords associated with the third advertisement displayed on the parked domain web page.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9304738B1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9304738B1-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9304738B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284192</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Unique Identifier">
      <data key="d0">Unique Identifier</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">An identifier associated with a parked domain web page, used to identify keywords and associate weights.&lt;SEP&gt;An identifier of the parked domain web page used to identify keywords of advertisements from the database.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9304738B1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9304738B1-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9304738B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284192</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="User Interest Indication">
      <data key="d0">User Interest Indication</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">An indication of user interest in an advertisement, including at least one of a click, a selection, a finger gesture, a mouse over, and a conversion.&lt;SEP&gt;An indication of a user's interest in an advertisement, including at least one of a click, a selection, a finger gesture, a mouse over, and a conversion.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9304738B1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9304738B1-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9304738B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284192</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Click">
      <data key="d0">Click</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">A user interaction constituting an indication of user interest in an advertisement.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9304738B1-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US9304738B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284192</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Conversion">
      <data key="d0">Conversion</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">A user interaction constituting an indication of user interest in an advertisement.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9304738B1-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US9304738B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284192</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Historic Performance">
      <data key="d0">Historic Performance</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Past performance on the parked domain web page of keywords corresponding to user interest of users other than the first user, used in determining keyword weights.&lt;SEP&gt;Past performance of keywords on the parked domain web page corresponding to user interest of users other than the first user, used in determining keyword weights.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9304738B1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9304738B1-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9304738B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284192</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Content Request">
      <data key="d0">Content Request</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">A request received from a user for content to provide for display with the parked domain web page.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9304738B1-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US9304738B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284192</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Keyword Ranking">
      <data key="d0">Keyword Ranking</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">The process of ranking keywords based on their weights to select a highest ranked keyword for content selection.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9304738B1-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US9304738B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284192</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Content Selection">
      <data key="d0">Content Selection</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">The process of selecting content, such as an advertisement, to provide for display with an information resource based on selected keywords or their weights.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9304738B1-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US9304738B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284192</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Second Information Resource">
      <data key="d0">Second Information Resource</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">An information resource on which the first keyword has a different weight than on the parked domain web page.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9304738B1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9304738B1-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;US9304738B1-chunk-002</data>
      <data key="d4">US9304738B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284192</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Characteristic">
      <data key="d0">Characteristic</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">An attribute associated with user interest used in determining keyword weights, including temporal, day, web page content slot, monetary, and performance characteristics.&lt;SEP&gt;Attributes of e-mail exchanges between pairs of users, including interaction frequency, interaction type, number of communication participants, time between interactions, time since first interaction, time since last interaction, interaction volume, and ratio of source to target versus target to source interactions.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9304738B1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US10778629B2-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9304738B1.txt&lt;SEP&gt;US10778629B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284708</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="User Interaction">
      <data key="d0">User Interaction</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">An interaction by a user with an advertisement displayed on the parked domain web page, used to assign keyword weights.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9304738B1-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US9304738B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284192</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Threshold Weight">
      <data key="d0">Threshold Weight</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">A weight value that a highest weighted keyword must satisfy for selection.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9304738B1-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9304738B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284192</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Computer Network">
      <data key="d0">Computer Network</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A network via which the system evaluates information.&lt;SEP&gt;A network over which requests, recommendations, and scores are transmitted between content sites, the personalization network service, and external recommenders.&lt;SEP&gt;A network over which requests from content sites for item recommendations are received.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9304738B1-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;US7991757B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US7991757B2-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9304738B1.txt&lt;SEP&gt;US7991757B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284383</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Non-Transitory Computer Readable Medium">
      <data key="d0">Non-Transitory Computer Readable Medium</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A medium having instructions to evaluate information, comprising instructions to perform the described operations.&lt;SEP&gt;A computer readable medium storing instructions, referenced in claim 18 and claim 19.&lt;SEP&gt;A medium containing executable instructions that when executed perform a method of generating relationship data.&lt;SEP&gt;A medium containing executable instructions that when executed perform a method of modeling relationships between e-mail users.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9304738B1-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;US9304738B1-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;US10778629B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US10778629B2-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9304738B1.txt&lt;SEP&gt;US10778629B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284708</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="First Weight">
      <data key="d0">First Weight</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">The weight of the first keyword on the parked domain web page, used in ranking the first keyword against the second keyword.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9304738B1-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;US9304738B1-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9304738B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284192</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Second Weight">
      <data key="d0">Second Weight</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">The weight of the second keyword determined based on the indication of user interest of the second user in the second advertisement.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9304738B1-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;US9304738B1-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9304738B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284192</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Indication Of User Interest">
      <data key="d0">Indication Of User Interest</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">A signal indicating the second user's interest in the second advertisement displayed on the parked domain web page.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9304738B1-chunk-002</data>
      <data key="d4">US9304738B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284192</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Request For Content">
      <data key="d0">Request For Content</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">A request from the third user for content to provide for display with the parked domain web page.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9304738B1-chunk-002</data>
      <data key="d4">US9304738B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284192</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="US9118735B1">
      <data key="d0">US9118735B1</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">A patent document titled "Finding people using social networks" that describes embodiments, a system, and a method for assisting a first person in finding a second person using social networks, including privacy mechanisms such as anonymizing identifying information and encrypting communications.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9118735B1-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US9118735B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284215</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Requesting Person">
      <data key="d0">Requesting Person</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A person who sends a request to a server identifying himself or herself, the person being sought, and the requestor's location, in order to find a target person using a social network.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9118735B1-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US9118735B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284215</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Target Person">
      <data key="d0">Target Person</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The second person whom the requesting person is trying to find through the social network.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9118735B1-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US9118735B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284215</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Connecting Person">
      <data key="d0">Connecting Person</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A person in the requesting person's social network who is likely to connect the requesting person's social network with the target person's social network and who has a last-known location within a predetermined distance from the requesting person's location.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9118735B1-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US9118735B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284215</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Social Network">
      <data key="d0">Social Network</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A network of relationships among people, comprising information from at least one social network service, used to connect a requesting person with a target person.&lt;SEP&gt;A network of users associated with the first user that can be determined, traversed, pruned, and combined from different types of social networks to identify connecting users.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9118735B1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9118735B1-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9118735B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284215</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Social Network Service">
      <data key="d0">Social Network Service</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A service that provides social network information used to determine a person's social network.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9118735B1-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US9118735B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284215</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Privacy Mechanism">
      <data key="d0">Privacy Mechanism</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Disclosed mechanisms for protecting privacy, including anonymizing identifying information and encrypting communications.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9118735B1-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US9118735B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284215</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Opt-In">
      <data key="d0">Opt-In</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A connecting person's consent to share information about his or her identity, social network, or location with people of at least as many degrees of separation as the number of degrees of separation for the type of relationship involved.&lt;SEP&gt;A user's consent to share information about his or her identity, social network, or location with users of at least as many degrees of separation as the number of degrees of separation for the type of relationship.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9118735B1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9118735B1-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9118735B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284215</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Degrees Of Separation">
      <data key="d0">Degrees Of Separation</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A measure of the number of intermediary connections between two people in a social network, associated with a type of relationship.&lt;SEP&gt;A measure of the number of connections between users, such as the first user and third user, that determines the type of relationship and opt-in sharing requirements.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9118735B1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9118735B1-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9118735B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284215</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Last-Known Location">
      <data key="d0">Last-Known Location</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">The most recent location determined for a person, which may be based on a wireless network, a geolocation provided by a computer, a venue, or an event the person has identified himself or herself as being at.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9118735B1-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US9118735B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284215</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Predetermined Distance">
      <data key="d0">Predetermined Distance</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">A threshold distance from the requesting person's location within which a connecting person's last-known location must fall.&lt;SEP&gt;A distance threshold within which the third user's last-known location must be from the location of the first user.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9118735B1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9118735B1-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9118735B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284215</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Wireless Network">
      <data key="d0">Wireless Network</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A network to which a connecting person's computer is connected, used to determine the last-known location of the connecting person.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9118735B1-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US9118735B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284215</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Geolocation">
      <data key="d0">Geolocation</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Location information provided by a connecting person's computer, used to determine the last-known location of the connecting person.&lt;SEP&gt;A geographic location provided by a computer of a user, such as the third user, used to determine proximity to the first user's location.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9118735B1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9118735B1-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9118735B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284215</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Venue">
      <data key="d0">Venue</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">A place that a connecting person has identified himself or herself as being at, used to determine the last-known location.&lt;SEP&gt;A place that a user, such as the third user, has identified himself or herself as being at, which may match the first user's location.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9118735B1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9118735B1-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9118735B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284215</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Event">
      <data key="d0">Event</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">An occurrence that a connecting person has identified himself or herself as being at, used to determine the last-known location.&lt;SEP&gt;An occurrence that a user, such as the third user, has identified himself or herself as being at, which may be the same event as the first user's location.&lt;SEP&gt;A condition registered for monitoring with regard to a history object, triggered when stored information describing an ETL process's performance satisfies specified criteria, causing a subscribed ETL process to be performed.&lt;SEP&gt;An event registered for monitoring with regard to the history object, triggered when the performance of the first ETL process satisfies criteria, and subscribed to by the second ETL process.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9118735B1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9118735B1-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;US11423041B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US11423041B2-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9118735B1.txt&lt;SEP&gt;US11423041B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284675</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Second Connecting Person">
      <data key="d0">Second Connecting Person</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">An additional person, also referred to as a fourth user, who is likely to connect the requesting person's social network with the target person's social network and whose response may be combined with the connecting person's response.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9118735B1-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US9118735B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284215</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Common Format">
      <data key="d0">Common Format</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A unified format to which responses from the computers of the connecting person and the second connecting person are converted before being combined.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9118735B1-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US9118735B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284215</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Fourth User">
      <data key="d0">Fourth User</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A user who may connect the first and third users, and whose identifier or response may be withheld based on negative affinity with the first user or an outdated last-known location.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9118735B1-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9118735B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284215</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Kiosk">
      <data key="d0">Kiosk</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A device having a pre-determined location at which the identifier associated with the first user may be received.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9118735B1-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9118735B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284215</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Non-Transitory Computer-Readable Storage Medium">
      <data key="d0">Non-Transitory Computer-Readable Storage Medium</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A storage medium bearing computer-executable instructions that, when executed on a computer, cause the computer to perform operations for assisting a first user in finding a second user using a social network.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9118735B1-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9118735B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284215</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Token">
      <data key="d0">Token</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A replacement value used to anonymize results by replacing an identifier associated with the second user.&lt;SEP&gt;A unit of the input query to which a label is assigned.&lt;SEP&gt;A segment of a query in the first language containing one or more terms, associated with components of the first query pattern and annotated with labels.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9118735B1-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;US9218390B2-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;US8655901B1-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US9118735B1.txt&lt;SEP&gt;US9218390B2.txt&lt;SEP&gt;US8655901B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284618</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Negative Affinity">
      <data key="d0">Negative Affinity</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A relationship condition between the first user and a fourth user that causes a determination not to return the fourth user's identifier.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9118735B1-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9118735B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284215</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Threshold Amount Of Time">
      <data key="d0">Threshold Amount Of Time</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A time limit used to determine whether a fourth user's last-known location is too old, causing the withholding of the fourth user's identifier or response.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9118735B1-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9118735B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284215</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Anonymized Results">
      <data key="d0">Anonymized Results</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Results produced by replacing an identifier associated with the second user with a token and encrypting the results.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9118735B1-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9118735B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284215</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Identifier">
      <data key="d0">Identifier</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">A value associated with a user, such as a name, image, location, or relationship, used to identify and determine social networks and users.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9118735B1-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9118735B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284215</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Recommendation Engine For Social Networks">
      <data key="d0">Recommendation Engine For Social Networks</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A patented recommendation engine (US8095432B1) that generates ranked recommendation lists for items based on relationship proximity between members of a social networking utility.</data>
      <data key="d3">US8095432B1-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US8095432B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284250</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Social Networking Utility">
      <data key="d0">Social Networking Utility</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A social network platform within which members are friends or non-friends of an inquiring member, and within which items can be searched and recommendations obtained.&lt;SEP&gt;A social network platform in which members have friends, non-friends, groups, and networks, and through which items can be searched, recommended, and purchased.</data>
      <data key="d3">US8095432B1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US8095432B1-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US8095432B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284250</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Inquiring Member">
      <data key="d0">Inquiring Member</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A member of the social networking utility who requests a search for an item, receives a recommendation list, and has friends and non-friends within the utility.&lt;SEP&gt;A member of the social networking utility who requests searches, receives recommendation lists, and may purchase items or share recommendations.</data>
      <data key="d3">US8095432B1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US8095432B1-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US8095432B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284250</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="First Member">
      <data key="d0">First Member</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A member of the social networking utility who is a friend of the inquiring member and provides a first recommendation for the item; shares a plurality of interests in common with the inquiring member.&lt;SEP&gt;A member of the social networking utility who is a friend of the inquiring member and provides a first recommendation for an item.</data>
      <data key="d3">US8095432B1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US8095432B1-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US8095432B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284250</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Second Member">
      <data key="d0">Second Member</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A member of the social networking utility who is a non-friend of the inquiring member and provides a second recommendation for the item.&lt;SEP&gt;A member of the social networking utility who is a non-friend of the inquiring member and provides a second recommendation for an item.</data>
      <data key="d3">US8095432B1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US8095432B1-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US8095432B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284250</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Third Member">
      <data key="d0">Third Member</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A member of the social networking utility who has a plurality of different interests than the inquiring member and provides a third recommendation for the item.&lt;SEP&gt;A member of the social networking utility who has different interests than the inquiring member and provides a third recommendation, and who may also be a third friend receiving recommendations.</data>
      <data key="d3">US8095432B1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US8095432B1-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US8095432B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284250</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Relationship Proximity">
      <data key="d0">Relationship Proximity</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A measure of closeness between a recommending member and the inquiring member, used to rank recommendations.&lt;SEP&gt;A measure of closeness between members within the social networking utility, closest for friends and farthest for strangers, used to rank recommendations.</data>
      <data key="d3">US8095432B1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US8095432B1-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US8095432B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284250</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Recommendation">
      <data key="d0">Recommendation</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">An opinion or endorsement of an item provided by a member of the social networking utility.&lt;SEP&gt;A suggestion sent to a user to play a second video content feature based on the relationship score.&lt;SEP&gt;A generated suggestion presented to another user for content or characters, based on preferences and relationship scores.</data>
      <data key="d3">US8095432B1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9374411B1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9374411B1-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US8095432B1.txt&lt;SEP&gt;US9374411B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284456</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Recommendation List">
      <data key="d0">Recommendation List</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">A generated list for the item comprising the first and second recommendations, with the first recommendation placed higher than the second based on the first rank exceeding the second rank.&lt;SEP&gt;A ranked list of recommendations for an item generated for the inquiring member, ordered by relationship proximity.</data>
      <data key="d3">US8095432B1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US8095432B1-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US8095432B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284250</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Item">
      <data key="d0">Item</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A product or object that can be recommended, searched for, tagged, priced, and purchased within the social networking utility.</data>
      <data key="d3">US8095432B1-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US8095432B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284250</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Processor">
      <data key="d0">Processor</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The term "Processor" refers to a hardware component or computing element that executes software programs and performs a wide range of computational and operational tasks across various system contexts. As a hardware component, the processor executes applications—such as a recommendation application—and carries out the core operations of a system. In the context of recommendation systems, it is used to determine relationship proximities, rank recommendations, and generate recommendation lists. It also performs computational steps such as clustering and estimating within various methods.

The processor may be a component of a network device, where it is operative to perform actions including first and second pass analyses and purging a classification model. When executing software programs, the processor is operable to perform steps such as receiving, extracting, and storing management data, as well as receiving data-streams, extracting management data, and storing it in a searchable format. In some configurations, the processor is caused by a software program to carry out actions such as receiving, extracting, and storing. It may also be a hardware component that performs the steps of establishing user relationships and executing a filtration method. Additionally, the processor can be coupled to memory and programmed by program code stored in that memory to implement the modules of an apparatus.&lt;SEP&gt;One or more processors in the system configured to interact with a computer-readable medium to perform the described operations.&lt;SEP&gt;At least one processor in a system that executes program instructions to implement the data catalog.&lt;SEP&gt;A component that generates relationship data by determining relationship strength associated with each pair of users.&lt;SEP&gt;A processor that generates relationship data by determining a relationship strength associated with each pair of users.&lt;SEP&gt;A component in communication with memory for executing stored instructions.</data>
      <data key="d3">US8095432B1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US8095432B1-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;US8880423B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US8069128B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US7756837B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US7756837B2-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;US7756837B2-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;US8719408B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US8719408B2-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;US8655901B1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US11423041B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US10778629B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US10778629B2-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;US9589231B2-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US8095432B1.txt&lt;SEP&gt;US8880423B2.txt&lt;SEP&gt;US8069128B2.txt&lt;SEP&gt;US7756837B2.txt&lt;SEP&gt;US8719408B2.txt&lt;SEP&gt;US8655901B1.txt&lt;SEP&gt;US11423041B2.txt&lt;SEP&gt;US10778629B2.txt&lt;SEP&gt;US9589231B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284737</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Memory">
      <data key="d0">Memory</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A storage component operatively connected to the processor in which the recommendation application resides.&lt;SEP&gt;A component of the apparatus operatively coupled to the processing device.&lt;SEP&gt;Memory coupled to the processor that stores program code programming the processor.&lt;SEP&gt;A memory storing program instructions that when executed by the at least one processor cause the processor to implement the data catalog.&lt;SEP&gt;A component that stores instructions for receiving queries, embedding cases, providing query types, and returning subsets.</data>
      <data key="d3">US8095432B1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US8095432B1-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;US9514120B1-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;US8719408B2-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;US11423041B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9589231B2-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US8095432B1.txt&lt;SEP&gt;US9514120B1.txt&lt;SEP&gt;US8719408B2.txt&lt;SEP&gt;US11423041B2.txt&lt;SEP&gt;US9589231B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284737</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Recommendation Application">
      <data key="d0">Recommendation Application</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A software application executing on a processor and resident in memory, configured to obtain recommendations for an item from members of a social networking utility, determine relationship proximities, rank recommendations, perform searches, and generate a recommendation list.&lt;SEP&gt;A software application executing on the processor and configured to obtain recommendations, rank them, and generate recommendation lists.</data>
      <data key="d3">US8095432B1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US8095432B1-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US8095432B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284250</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Inventory Management System">
      <data key="d0">Inventory Management System</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A system that provides inventory details associated with items to be associated with recommendations.</data>
      <data key="d3">US8095432B1-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US8095432B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284250</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="News Feed">
      <data key="d0">News Feed</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">A feed of the inquiring member that can be updated to include price changes such as a reduced price.</data>
      <data key="d3">US8095432B1-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US8095432B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284250</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Fan Group">
      <data key="d0">Fan Group</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A group associated with an item to which the inquiring member can be added.</data>
      <data key="d3">US8095432B1-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US8095432B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284250</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Searchable Tags">
      <data key="d0">Searchable Tags</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Tags generated for an item and associated with the item to enable searching.</data>
      <data key="d3">US8095432B1-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US8095432B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284250</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Inventory Details">
      <data key="d0">Inventory Details</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Details associated with an item that are received and associated with recommendations.</data>
      <data key="d3">US8095432B1-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US8095432B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284250</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Inventory Management Reports">
      <data key="d0">Inventory Management Reports</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Reports generated for an item.</data>
      <data key="d3">US8095432B1-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US8095432B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284250</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Purchase Transaction">
      <data key="d0">Purchase Transaction</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">A transaction performed for the item in response to a received request to purchase the item.&lt;SEP&gt;A transaction performed for an item upon receiving a request to purchase the item.</data>
      <data key="d3">US8095432B1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US8095432B1-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US8095432B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284250</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Payment">
      <data key="d0">Payment</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Money received upon a purchase of an item or for each click associated with an item.&lt;SEP&gt;A payment made to an expert for formulating a diagnosis when the query-for-experts is selected.</data>
      <data key="d3">US8095432B1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9589231B2-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US8095432B1.txt&lt;SEP&gt;US9589231B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284737</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Reduced Price">
      <data key="d0">Reduced Price</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">A lowered price for an item that modifies the item's price and is included in the inquiring member's news feed.</data>
      <data key="d3">US8095432B1-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US8095432B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284250</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Interests">
      <data key="d0">Interests</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Common or differing interests among members used to compare and rank recommendations.</data>
      <data key="d3">US8095432B1-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US8095432B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284250</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Network">
      <data key="d0">Network</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The set of members connected to the inquiring member, within which friends reside and outside of which non-friends reside.&lt;SEP&gt;A network comprising a diagnosis assistance system and a set of user devices linking requesters and experts with the system.</data>
      <data key="d3">US8095432B1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9589231B2-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US8095432B1.txt&lt;SEP&gt;US9589231B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284737</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Favorite Items">
      <data key="d0">Favorite Items</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A plurality of items identified as favorites of the inquiring member, which can be shared with a network of the inquiring member.&lt;SEP&gt;Items identified as favorites of the inquiring member that can be shared with the inquiring member's network.</data>
      <data key="d3">US8095432B1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US8095432B1-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US8095432B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284250</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="First Recommendation">
