    <node id="User">
      <data key="d0">User</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">The term "User" refers to an individual who interacts with various systems, interfaces, and content across multiple contexts. In the context of search and inventory systems, a User is an individual who has previously submitted search keywords and viewed pages, thereby providing the history used for inventory estimation. In the context of error reporting, a User is an individual who provides feedback on potential typographical errors in a work via a graphical user interface. In messaging systems, a User is a person enabled to move an identified message to another message folder and who may select the multi-pass message filter for execution through an interface on the client device; relatedly, a User is a person for whom messages are sorted into folders and who is enabled to move identified misclassified messages to another folder.

In the context of media and content consumption, a User is a person associated with a client who interacts with video content features and expresses preferences toward characters, receiving content recommendations. Similarly, a User is an individual who interacts with network content and expresses preferences toward characters, and a User who interacts with a user interface and may express explicit feedback favoring a fictional character. In the context of digital media distribution and relationships, a User is an individual for whom user relationships are established and to whom filtered digital media content is presented with priority based on relevancy weights. Finally, a User is a user who has relationships with content producers, has a user profile, and receives presented digital media content.</data>
      <data key="d3">US8880423B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9514120B1-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;US8069128B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US8069128B2-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;US9374411B1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9374411B1-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;US9374411B1-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;US8719408B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US8719408B2-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US8880423B2.txt&lt;SEP&gt;US9514120B1.txt&lt;SEP&gt;US8069128B2.txt&lt;SEP&gt;US9374411B1.txt&lt;SEP&gt;US8719408B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284592</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
