      <data key="d0">US8917913B2</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">A patent document titled "Searching with face recognition and social networking profiles" describing systems for on-line searching using face recognition and social networking profiles.</data>
      <data key="d3">US8917913B2-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US8917913B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284304</data>
