    <node id="Social Networking Service">
      <data key="d0">Social Networking Service</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A service that has associated therewith a plurality of member profiles corresponding to a respective plurality of members, each profile including member descriptors and member images with face representations.&lt;SEP&gt;An online service that maintains member images and indications of friendships between members, and which is in operative communication with a search service.</data>
      <data key="d3">US8917913B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US8917913B2-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US8917913B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284304</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Search Service">
      <data key="d0">Search Service</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A service associated with the social networking service that compares face representations in a source image to face representations in member images of friends, and returns results identifying matching members. It may be integrated into the social networking service.&lt;SEP&gt;A service associated with the social networking service that compares search terms to member descriptors and compares face representations in a source image to face representations in member images, returning results to the mobile device.</data>
      <data key="d3">US8917913B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US8917913B2-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US8917913B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284304</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Application">
      <data key="d0">Application</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">An application associated with the mobile device that is in operative communication with the camera, provides a user interface, receives search terms and source images, and communicates with the search service.&lt;SEP&gt;Software associated with the mobile device that is in operative communication with the camera, provides a user interface, receives friend identifiers and source images, and displays results on the screen.&lt;SEP&gt;Software executable in a computing device that causes the device to perform content recommendation functions.&lt;SEP&gt;Software executed by a computing device that causes it to perform content rendering, character identification, and recommendation generation.</data>
      <data key="d3">US8917913B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US8917913B2-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;US9374411B1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9374411B1-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US8917913B2.txt&lt;SEP&gt;US9374411B1.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284456</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
