      <data key="d0">Multi-Pass Ad-Hoc Spam Message Filtering</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A filtering approach that dynamically generates a temporary classifier during a first pass based on results of a previously applied message filter, then uses it in a second pass to retrospectively inspect messages for misclassification.</data>
      <data key="d3">US8069128B2-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US8069128B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284410</data>
