      <data key="d0">First Message Filter</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A message filter used by a network device to assign messages to different message folders and configured to store first classification data in a persistent store; it is automatically executed independent of a user action.&lt;SEP&gt;A message filter that previously sorts messages into various folders for a user and stores first classification data in a persistent store.</data>
      <data key="d3">US8069128B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US8069128B2-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US8069128B2.txt</data>
