      <data key="d2">Classification data generated by the first pass of the multi-pass message filter to train the filter; it resides exclusively in a non-persistent memory store at the client device and is deleted upon providing the display of information.&lt;SEP&gt;Classification data generated by the first pass of the multi-pass message filter, configured to reside exclusively in a non-persistent memory store and deleted after use.</data>
