      <data key="d2">A patent document titled "Content recommendations using deep data" that discloses various embodiments for recommending content for users based on character preferences and relationship scores.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9374411B1-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US9374411B1.txt</data>
