      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A feature function representing transitions between states, including fk(lt−1, lt, Q), trained on a labeled set.&lt;SEP&gt;A feature representing a state transition, trained on a labeled set with learning limited relative to learning the output state features.&lt;SEP&gt;A feature representing transitions between states, trained on a labeled set with learning limited relative to output state features.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9218390B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9218390B2-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;US9218390B2-chunk-002</data>
