    <node id="US7756837B2">
      <data key="d0">US7756837B2</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">A patent document titled "Methods and apparatus for searching backup data based on content and attributes" that discloses transparent bridging of backup storage devices and extraction of management data from backup data-streams.</data>
      <data key="d3">US7756837B2-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US7756837B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284546</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Backup Storage Device">
      <data key="d0">Backup Storage Device</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A device on which data-streams are archived and to which data-streams are passed before, during, or after extraction.&lt;SEP&gt;A storage device intended for archiving data-streams; an intermediate device transparently imitates such a device so that backup software sends its data-stream to it as part of the standard backup process.&lt;SEP&gt;A device on which the data-stream is intended to be archived and to which the data-stream is delivered.&lt;SEP&gt;A device intended to store and archive data-streams, to which data-streams are delivered transparently.</data>
      <data key="d3">US7756837B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US7756837B2-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;US7756837B2-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;US7756837B2-chunk-003</data>
      <data key="d4">US7756837B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284546</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Backup Software">
      <data key="d0">Backup Software</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Software that produces backup data-streams and sends them to a storage device, identifying an intermediate device as a standard backup storage device.</data>
      <data key="d3">US7756837B2-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US7756837B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284546</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Data-Stream">
      <data key="d0">Data-Stream</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">A stream of data intended for archiving on a backup storage device, from which management data is extracted.&lt;SEP&gt;A stream of data intended for archiving on a backup storage device, from which management data is extracted and which is also stored on the backup storage device.&lt;SEP&gt;A stream of data received from one or more sources and intended for archiving on a backup storage device; management data is extracted from it.</data>
      <data key="d3">US7756837B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US7756837B2-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;US7756837B2-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;US7756837B2-chunk-003</data>
      <data key="d4">US7756837B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284546</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Management Data">
      <data key="d0">Management Data</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">Data extracted from a data-stream, including source identifier, volume information, metadata, data file type information, and keywords.&lt;SEP&gt;Data extracted from a data-stream describing its contents, including source identifiers, volume information, metadata, data file types, and keywords; stored in a searchable format in a database.&lt;SEP&gt;Data extracted from the data-stream, including source identifier, volume information, metadata, data file type information, and keywords of the data files.&lt;SEP&gt;Data extracted from a data-stream including source identifier, volume information, metadata, data file types, and keywords.</data>
      <data key="d3">US7756837B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US7756837B2-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;US7756837B2-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;US7756837B2-chunk-003</data>
      <data key="d4">US7756837B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284549</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Intermediate Device">
      <data key="d0">Intermediate Device</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A device that is transparent to the source producing the data-stream, appearing to the source as a backup storage device while extracting and storing management data.</data>
      <data key="d3">US7756837B2-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US7756837B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284549</data>
