      <data key="d0">Internet</data>
      <data key="d1">other</data>
      <data key="d2">The communication network identified in dependent claims as the network used for transmitting queries and responses.&lt;SEP&gt;The communication network over which queries and responses may be transmitted electronically.&lt;SEP&gt;A communication network over which queries and responses may be transmitted electronically.</data>
      <data key="d3">US7756837B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US7756837B2-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;US7756837B2-chunk-002</data>
