      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A program executed by a processor, causing the processor to perform data-stream archiving steps.&lt;SEP&gt;A program executed by a processor to perform steps including receiving data-streams and extracting management data.&lt;SEP&gt;A program contained on a storage medium that causes a processor to carry out actions.</data>
      <data key="d3">US7756837B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US7756837B2-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;US7756837B2-chunk-002</data>
