      <data key="d0">Predetermined Rule Set</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A rule set used to recognize distinct data sets of a data-stream, based on a data-stream protocol of a third party backup data product.&lt;SEP&gt;A rule set used to recognize distinct data sets of the data-stream, based on a data-stream protocol of a third party backup data product.</data>
