      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">A patent document titled "Maintaining data lineage to detect data events" describing systems and methods for maintaining history of data objects to detect data events in ETL processes.</data>
      <data key="d3">US11423041B2-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US11423041B2.txt</data>
