    <node id="Data Catalog">
      <data key="d0">Data Catalog</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A component implemented for an Extract, Transform, Load (ETL) service that receives indications of ETL processes, stores history objects, evaluates stored information against event criteria, and causes subscribed ETL processes to be performed.&lt;SEP&gt;A component of an ETL service that receives indications of ETL processes, stores history object instances in a history data structure, and evaluates stored performance information against criteria for triggering events.</data>
      <data key="d3">US11423041B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US11423041B2-chunk-001</data>
