      <data key="d0">Notification</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A message sent to one or more subscribers for an event when the event is triggered.&lt;SEP&gt;A notification of the event sent to another subscriber different than the second ETL process when the performance of the first ETL process satisfies the criteria.</data>
      <data key="d3">US11423041B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US11423041B2-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US11423041B2.txt</data>
