      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A service that performs both the first ETL process and the second ETL process.&lt;SEP&gt;A service that performs Extract, Transform, Load processes and provides a data catalog for monitoring ETL process performance and triggering subscribed events.</data>
      <data key="d3">US11423041B2-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;US11423041B2-chunk-002</data>
