      <data key="d0">Second ETL Process</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A second extract-transform-load process that is also performed by the ETL service.&lt;SEP&gt;An Extract, Transform, Load process subscribed to an event that is triggered when the performance of the first ETL process satisfies criteria; it may be applied to the transformed data objects.</data>
      <data key="d3">US11423041B2-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;US11423041B2-chunk-002</data>
