      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">A database of e-mail exchanges between pairs of users of an e-mail system, populated by monitoring e-mail exchanges and extracting relevant exchanges, and storing characteristics of those exchanges.&lt;SEP&gt;A database of e-mail exchanges between pairs of users, populated by monitoring e-mail exchanges and extracting relevant e-mail exchanges through a direct internet access protocol.</data>
      <data key="d3">US10778629B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US10778629B2-chunk-001</data>
