    <node id="US9589231B2">
      <data key="d0">US9589231B2</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">A patent publication titled "Social medical network for diagnosis assistance" describing a method and system for assisting medical diagnosis by exploiting similarity between new medical cases and existing cases and experts in a common embedding space.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9589231B2-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US9589231B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284737</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Social Medical Network For Diagnosis Assistance">
      <data key="d0">Social Medical Network For Diagnosis Assistance</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">The title of patent US9589231B2, referring to a network-based approach for assisting diagnosis through similarity matching of medical cases and experts.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9589231B2-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US9589231B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284737</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Diagnosis Assistance Method">
      <data key="d0">Diagnosis Assistance Method</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A method that receives a query request including a new medical case, embeds the new case in an embedding space containing existing medical cases and experts, allows selection between query-for-cases and query-for-experts, and returns subsets based on computed similarity.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9589231B2-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US9589231B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284737</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Embedding Space">
      <data key="d0">Embedding Space</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A multidimensional space in which new medical cases, existing medical cases, and experts are represented.&lt;SEP&gt;A common multidimensional space in which new medical cases, existing medical cases, and experts are embedded so that similarity between their representations can be computed.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9589231B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9589231B2-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9589231B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284737</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="New Medical Case">
      <data key="d0">New Medical Case</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">A medical case submitted by a requester for which a diagnosis is sought, embedded in an embedding space.&lt;SEP&gt;A medical case submitted by a requester in a query request, comprising a plurality of records relating to a specific patient, which is embedded in the embedding space.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9589231B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9589231B2-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9589231B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284737</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Existing Medical Cases">
      <data key="d0">Existing Medical Cases</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">A set of previously known medical cases embedded in the embedding space and used for similarity comparison.&lt;SEP&gt;A set of previously stored medical cases embedded in the embedding space, used as candidates for similarity matching against a new medical case.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9589231B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9589231B2-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9589231B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284737</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Experts">
      <data key="d0">Experts</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A set of experts embedded in the embedding space who can be queried and to whom a new case may be communicated for diagnosis.&lt;SEP&gt;A set of medical experts embedded in the embedding space based on information such as their profiles, coded medical procedures performed, authored articles, and linked stored medical cases.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9589231B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9589231B2-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9589231B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284737</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Requester">
      <data key="d0">Requester</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A user who submits a query request including a new medical case and selects from query types.&lt;SEP&gt;A user who submits a query request including a new medical case and selects from available query types.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9589231B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9589231B2-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9589231B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284737</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Query-For-Cases">
      <data key="d0">Query-For-Cases</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A query type that returns a subset of existing cases based on computed similarity between the embedded new case and embedded existing cases.&lt;SEP&gt;A query type that, when selected, returns a subset of existing medical cases based on computed similarity between the embedded new case and the embedded existing cases.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9589231B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9589231B2-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9589231B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284737</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Query-For-Experts">
      <data key="d0">Query-For-Experts</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">A query type that returns a subset of experts based on computed similarity between the embedded new case and embedded experts.&lt;SEP&gt;A query type that, when selected, returns a subset of experts based on computed similarity between the embedded new case and the embedded experts.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9589231B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9589231B2-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9589231B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284737</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Query Cost">
      <data key="d0">Query Cost</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A computed cost for a query, differing between query-for-experts and query-for-cases.&lt;SEP&gt;A computed cost for a query, where the cost for a query-for-experts is different from and higher than the cost for a query-for-cases, encouraging requesters to try query-by-cases first.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9589231B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9589231B2-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9589231B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284737</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Medical Ontology">
      <data key="d0">Medical Ontology</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A set of medical concepts joined by links, each concept corresponding to a dimension in the multidimensional representation, used as the basis for embedding medical cases and experts.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9589231B2-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US9589231B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284737</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Unified Medical Language System">
      <data key="d0">Unified Medical Language System</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">A medical ontology on which the embedding of medical cases and experts is based.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9589231B2-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US9589231B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284737</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Matrix Of Proximities">
      <data key="d0">Matrix Of Proximities</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">A matrix applied to the multidimensional representation of the new case that accounts for relationships between concepts in the ontology when computing similarity measures.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9589231B2-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US9589231B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284737</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Public Database">
      <data key="d0">Public Database</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">A database from which documents are returned, when query-for-cases is selected, based on computed similarity between the embedded new case and embedded documents.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9589231B2-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US9589231B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284737</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Diagnosis">
      <data key="d0">Diagnosis</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The determination sought for a new medical case, which an expert may attempt to provide.&lt;SEP&gt;The medical determination formulated by a selected expert to whom a new case is provided.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9589231B2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;US9589231B2-chunk-001</data>
      <data key="d4">US9589231B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284737</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Patient Records">
      <data key="d0">Patient Records</data>
      <data key="d1">data</data>
      <data key="d2">A plurality of records relating to a specific patient that make up the new medical case, including laboratory test results, images, symptom descriptions, patient monitor results, diagnoses, prescribed medications and treatments.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9589231B2-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US9589231B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284737</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="System For Diagnosis Assistance">
      <data key="d0">System For Diagnosis Assistance</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A system comprising memory storing instructions for performing the diagnosis assistance method and a processor in communication with the memory for executing the instructions.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9589231B2-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US9589231B2.txt</data>
      <data key="d5">1793284737</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Computer Program Product">
      <data key="d0">Computer Program Product</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A product comprising a non-transitory recording medium storing instructions that, when executed on a computer, cause the computer to perform the diagnosis assistance method.</data>
      <data key="d3">US9589231B2-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">US9589231B2.txt</data>
